<title>USA: Excel Comm. names Nicholas Merrick CFO.</title>
<headline>Excel Comm. names Nicholas Merrick CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Excel Communications Inc said Monday it had named Nicholas Merrick chief financial officer and executive vice president effective upon the completion of the company's merger with Telco Communications Group Inc.</p>
<p>Prior to completion of the merger, Merrick will continue to serve as CFO at Telco Communications, the company said.</p>
<p>Merrick will take over from John McLaine, who was recently named to the posts of president and chief operating officer.</p>
</text>
